1
00:00:00,142 --> 00:00:04,022
(Sheldon:)I'm sure he didn't care about
silly superstitions like funerals.

2
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:05,390
(Sheldon:)You know, if he were here,

3
00:00:05,548 --> 00:00:07,888
(Sheldon:)I think he'd say,
"Enjoy Star Wars Day."

4
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:11,460
(Leonard:)He was 84.
He'd say, "Where's my pudding?"

5
00:00:13,222 --> 00:00:15,392
(Raj:)Before you go, at least
let me pack you some

6
00:00:15,558 --> 00:00:17,698
(Raj:)Attack of the Scones
for the road.

7
00:00:18,694 --> 00:00:20,974
(Penny:)Oh, like Attack of the Clones.

8
00:00:21,130 --> 00:00:23,080
We are leaving right now!

9
00:00:26,202 --> 00:00:28,012
(Amy:)Arthur passing away
was harder on Sheldon

10
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:29,480
(Amy:)than he's ready to admit.

11
00:00:29,638 --> 00:00:30,848
(Amy:)Really hoping this will cheer him up.

12
00:00:31,006 --> 00:00:32,416
(Bernadette:)Me, too.

13
00:00:32,575 --> 00:00:34,055
(Bernadette:)Although, it might've been
thoughtless of us

14
00:00:34,210 --> 00:00:35,750
(Bernadette:)to bake a Death Star cake.

15
00:00:37,046 --> 00:00:39,926
(Amy:)No, it combines two of

16
00:00:40,082 --> 00:00:42,752
(Amy:)chocolate chips and the ability
to destroy a planet

17
00:00:42,918 --> 00:00:44,488
(Amy:)at the push of a button.

18
00:00:45,821 --> 00:00:47,931
(Bernadette:)Well, anyway, it'll be
a nice surprise for the boys.

19
00:00:48,090 --> 00:00:50,090
(Bernadette:)And Howie doesn't think
I take his interests seriously,

20
00:00:50,259 --> 00:00:52,599
(Bernadette:)so hopefully this will keep
him fooled for a while.

21
00:00:53,762 --> 00:00:56,602
OK, let's get the fondant
and start decorating.

22
00:00:56,765 --> 00:00:58,105
(Bernadette:)This is pretty cool.

23
00:00:58,267 --> 00:01:04,027
(Bernadette:)You don't see too many
spherical cakes.

